How to create a job in jenkins and run it.
Create new job (+ New Item) -->Provide Job name and click freestyle project. and click on enabled OK button.
Now configure the job.
Click on Advanced -->Use Custom Workspace and provide the framework location.
Go to Build Steps-->Add Build Steps-->Execute Window Batch command
Provide the below cmds..
call .venv\Scripts\activate
pytest -v -s -n=2
save the configuration
click on build now button to run the job manually.


How to run the jenkins job automatically (daily, every 2mins...)
Go to configure of job. Build Triggeres-->Build Periodically-->Schedule -- and provide H/15 * * * *
We can see help also by pressing on the question mark of Schedule
